{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10081","headline":"酬兵部李侍郎晚过东厅之作 · 包佶","name":"酬兵部李侍郎晚过东厅之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酒礼慙先祭，刑书已旷官。\n诏驰黄纸速，身在绦纱安。\n圣位登堂静，生徒跪席寒。\n庭槐暂摇落，幸爲入春看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10081.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10081","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}